  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Polynesian Health Corridors Core Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Polynesian Health Corridors (PHC) is a five-year programme delivered by a unit in the Public Health Agency, Manat&#x16b; Hauora Ministry of Health.&#xa0; The delivery unit manages design, implementation and monitoring of programme workstreams and engages with partner countries to facilitate access to Aotearoa New Zealand health system counterparts. This Activity funds the delivery unit, workstream design, evaluation and stakeholder engagement costs.</narrative>
  </description>
